# Lunara needs no configuration to run. Everything below is optional.

# Optional palm photo analysis service (HTTPS only). When set, the questionnaire
# offers to upload the user's palm photo, with an explicit consent prompt, to
# pre-fill answers. The server must hold any model/API keys - NEVER put private
# keys in EXPO_PUBLIC_* variables, because they are bundled into the app.
# Contract: see src/features/palm/analyzer.ts
# EXPO_PUBLIC_PALM_ANALYSIS_URL=https://your-backend.example.com/palm/analyze
